{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02517","headline":"游清都观寻沈道士得芳字 · 赵中虚","name":"游清都观寻沈道士得芳字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青谿阻千仞，姑射藐汾阳。\n未若游兹境，探玄衆妙场。\n鹤来疑羽客，云泛似霓裳。\n寓目虽灵宇，游神乃帝乡。\n道存真理得，心灰俗累忘。\n烟霞凝抗殿，松桂肃长廊。\n早蝉清暮响，崇兰散晚芳。\n即此翔寥廓，非复控榆枋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵中虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}